            "review_title": "Review at Japanese Udon Donnosuke Mi Vang",
            "review_text": "JamonaJava\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam71 contributions\n1\nGreat surprise, perhaps the best Japanese in HCM マジに美味いです\nOct 2018 • Family\nMy complaint in District 7 has been lack of a decent Japanese restaurant despite of presence of substantial Japanese community. When I found this Donnosuke restaurant a few weeks ago, everything has changed. \n\nIn HCM, Ginza Koroson restaurant in Takashimaya Department Store is widely considered the best Japanese restaurant among the local Japanese community. Donnosuke is on par with that high end restaurant. I have tried 5-6 dishes from a several different Udon dishes, donburi, unagi, to few others, every single dish was served upmost care, and absolutely went beyond my expectation. \n\nNice additions are surprisingly big portion and very reasonable price. Menu covers a range of excellent daily dishes. That means this is a perfect place to become a regular, if you like Japanese food.\n\nStaffs are very well trained, motivated, and paying care to every part of the floor, which makes dining experience very rewarding. Myself and my companions have left the restaurant with a great sense of joy and happiness. \n\nHighly recommended\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 5, 2018",
